README DETAILS

# How the game works
 - Welcome to my NAASII game where the goal of the game is to get more points than the other 
person in the 4 rolls that you are given with multiple 12 sided die!

- While this code is not exaclty like the original Naasii game created by Kenna Alexander https://www.coyoteandcrow.net/ , it is the best version of my ability.

-You will each roll a maximun of 4 times to try and get the most points.

-To play this game you must have python installed as well as another person to play agaisnt. 



# NAASII Game instructions

1. Enter the code under this file name: Naasii
2. Press "Enter" to start the game where you will then enter the name for player 1, then press enter again to enter the name for player 2.
3. Player 1 will roll first by following the directions that will be displayed (Press Enter to play, move on, and or roll).
4. It will then be player 2's turn and they will complete the same steps (press enter to roll).
5. Follow the instructions provided on the screen untill the winner is announced!
6. Good luck and have fun! May the luckiest player win!
 
